  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#ForColombia a New Home</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The will is the greatest weapon to change the world.  Colombia is a country in the far north of South America. Actually, there are more than 19 million people in poverty. This can mean many things: improvised houses, dirt floors, lack of access to public services such as water and sanitation and being ignored and excluded from the rest of society.   That&apos;s why at TECHO, #ForColombia we want to build 150 houses for families who live in poverty for protects dignity and creates opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
